From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Active ESL <engineering@active-esl.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 14:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] frt: use pkg-config for SDL2

Yocto exposes target dependencies through pkg-config. Avoid relying on the
host-oriented sdl2-config helper during cross compilation.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Yocto-specific]
---
 platform/frt/SCsub | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/platform/frt/SCsub b/platform/frt/SCsub
index 84b73ee..1019179 100644
--- a/platform/frt/SCsub
+++ b/platform/frt/SCsub
@@ -40,5 +40,5 @@ env.TEXT('license.gen.cc', 'LICENSE')
 
 frt_env = env.Clone()
-frt_env.ParseConfig('sdl2-config --cflags --libs')
+frt_env.ParseConfig('pkg-config sdl2 --cflags --libs')
 
 common_sources = [ 'frt_exe.cc', 'frt.cc', 'license.gen.cc' ]
-- 
2.43.0
